  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dbac1a8f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 7. Extra Visualization: Degree Distribution and Most Popular Activities\n",
    "The network drawing above is great for seeing overall shape, but it's hard to read exact numbers off\n",
    "of it. So as a second, different type of visual, we'll plot two simple charts: a **histogram** of\n",
    "how spread out node degrees are across the whole graph, and a **bar chart** of the 10 most popular\n",
    "course activities (the ones with the most connected students)."
   ]
  },
